  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_014 (multimodal, multiprofile, scvi_n200, imagenet_vit_l, transformer, weighted) achieves 0.725 validation accuracy at 3.60 GPU hours. This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with resnet50 (cheaper, ~3.0 GPU hours) while keeping the RNA encoder and other components identical. It clarifies if the high accuracy in config_014 depends on the image encoder choice, offering a cost-effective alternative with minimal architectural change. This balances exploitation of the current best setup with cost-conscious exploration."
